WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.380
Well, being Colombian means a lot of things.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:10.480
Colombia is a country of great diversity, and in my case, being an artist, a musician,

00:00:11.119 --> 00:00:20.960
it means carrying many rhythms with you, that joy, that constant happiness that you pass on to everyone.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.740
That's the beautiful, the lovely, the wonderful part of being Colombian.
